    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 5 11]\ntheorem green_25.lower :\n    let ans := (answer(sorry) : ℕ → ℝ)\n    (bestLower =o[atTop] ans) ∧\n    (∀ᶠ N in atTop, 1 ≤ ans N ∧ ans N ≤ N) ∧\n    ∀ k : ℕ → ℕ,\n      (∀ᶠ N in atTop, 1 ≤ k N ∧ k N ≤ N) ∧\n      ((fun N => (k N : ℝ)) ≪ ans) →\n      ∀ᶠ N in atTop, Property25 (k N) N",
